18:01.300 --> 18:04.850
Could you be Elizabeth from the Wholen family?

18:04.850 --> 18:05.850
Yes.

18:06.270 --> 18:10.690
Um, Coach... Do you know Eli-chan?

18:10.690 --> 18:18.240
Ah, it's because a while back I went to the United
Kingdom to train for the Soft Tennis All-Japan cup.{because of the Soft Tennis All-Japan training, I went to England.}

18:19.030 --> 18:23.700
The family that took care of me while I trained had a daughter: her.

18:23.700 --> 18:27.080
I didn't know why, but she liked to stick to me.

18:27.080 --> 18:29.460
Eh? So that's it.

18:29.460 --> 18:31.540
But why did you come to Japan?

18:31.540 --> 18:34.090
Because Mishi and I made a promise.

18:34.090 --> 18:37.550
Promise? Did I make a promise?

18:37.550 --> 18:38.430
Yes.

18:38.430 --> 18:43.390
If I still like tennis after growing up,

18:43.390 --> 18:47.850
then even marriage is possible{allowed}.

18:49.480 --> 18:55.030
Marriage... You... Could it be that you... took those words... seriously?

18:55.280 --> 19:00.610
You... LOLICON PONYTAIL!

19:01.410 --> 19:02.990
Idiot, Idiot!

19:02.070 --> 19:03.330
Kotone-chan!

19:10.500 --> 19:12.790
