19:35.360 --> 19:38.400
You're pretty good.

19:38.400 --> 19:42.110
Three-time Elementary School Karate Competition
champion, and that without sustaining any injuries.

19:42.110 --> 19:45.120
Called the type of genius that is born only once a decade.{Called a genius that is born once(met only) every ten years.}

19:45.120 --> 19:48.950
