20:25.620 --> 20:31.120
"Standing at the top forever is surprisingly boring."

20:34.420 --> 20:37.880
If you don't like it, that's fine.

20:37.880 --> 20:39.920
Decide yourself. {You do what you like to do on your end}

20:40.170 --> 20:45.970
But, if you want to try standing at the top of
something else{other area}, you're always welcome.

20:46.720 --> 20:48.470
Albeit as a challenger. {Is that a Hajime no Ippo reference?} {Like a challenger }

20:53.770 --> 20:57.360
