21:00.570 --> 21:03.490
Interesting! Let's try it!

21:03.490 --> 21:09.200
All right! For starters, I will win{conquer} the Soft Tennis Wimbledon!

21:10.330 --> 21:11.790
Stupid Mishi.

21:11.790 --> 21:14.660
What's with calling a teacher stupid?

21:21.840 --> 21:23.550
W-What is it?

21:23.550 --> 21:24.760
Nothing.

21:25.600 --> 21:31.220
Anyway, I talked to you here a year ago too. {Come to think of it, a year ago I had a talk with you here too}

21:31.220 --> 21:35.140
I forgot to tell you something. {I forgot to tell you something that time }

21:37.850 --> 21:39.480
