21:46.450 --> 21:50.830
All right! For starters, I will win{conquer} the Soft Tennis Wimbledon!{See 21:13}

21:50.830 --> 21:54.700
Seriously, just like a passionate idiot from a manga...

21:54.700 --> 21:59.380
But, this kind of fighting spirit is exactly what is needed.

21:59.380 --> 22:03.250
Although soft tennis doesn't have a Wimbledon.

22:03.840 --> 22:05.880
I'll remember it sometime.

22:05.880 --> 22:09.720
You lie! Remember it now! Right now!

22:12.140 --> 22:16.480
What kind of softness it is; I will remember it soon.

22:16.480 --> 22:18.480
Please stop it. {Please stop it, the both of you}

22:18.480 --> 22:21.020
Go use{find} Chitose-san if you want to do it.

22:24.650 --> 22:27.400
