22:53.290 --> 22:58.590
takaku takaku ude wo nobashita

22:53.290 --> 22:58.590
高く高く腕を伸ばした

22:58.680 --> 23:04.070
<b><i>Knowing that they wouldn't reach</i></b>

22:58.680 --> 23:04.070
todokanai koto kurai wakatteru kedo

22:58.680 --> 23:04.070
届かないことくらいわかってるけど

